A||N||42||Jay||Canadians: Drag Strip this week-end!!||||1||
Z||000000||Jay||05-30-2001||06:50 PM||||Okay, Darknights is holding another Import and sub compact domestic showdown this week-end June 3, 2001.  It will be at the Cayuga International Dragway,  Starting from 10:00am till whenever.  Lot's of Fieros will be there including myself.  JohnnyK, Grinthock, Banditbalz and the rest of you Canadians, I would love to see you all there.  For directions see <A HREF="http://www.cayugadragway.com" TARGET=_blank>www.cayugadragway.com</A>  or phone them direct at 905-772-0303<P>Let's kick some Honda ass!!! (and hope not too many of them kick ours!) <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Jay<BR>1986 Northstar GT<BR>www.members.home.net/jaygrande<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/gangster.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||grinthock||05-30-2001||07:40 PM||||i'm gonna be there?  Gosh I wasn't informed that I was gonna be there...... I guess....<P><BR>I AM GONNA BE THERE!!! <P>Jay --- When you driving down, let's setup the usual convoy?  We meeting at Timmies in Hammytown again?||||reg||1
Z||000002||Jay||05-30-2001||07:47 PM||||i'VE GOT BE THERE AT 10:00AM SO I'M MEETING SOME PEOPLE IN TORONTO (NOT FIEROS).  I WILL HAVE MORE DETAILS OF THE MEET TONIGHT OR TOMORROW.  I'LL KEEP YOU ALL INFORMED.  ANYONE ELSE INTERESTED?<P>------------------<BR>Jay<BR>1986 Northstar GT<BR>www.members.home.net/jaygrande<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/kick.gif">  <BR>THE NORTHSTAR GIVES YOU A REAL KICK IN THE ASS!!!||||reg||1
Z||000003||banditbalz||05-30-2001||07:49 PM||||Sounds good Jay but....<BR>I Just Had The fiero Shop (RaceTech) put a new tranny (same gears) and fresh clutch in my GT. Mireamme says I need a 500km/h break-in period.<BR>I don't suppose burnouts are an effective way to break in the clutch are they? Anyways, i will probably be there on the Sunday.<BR>was looking to pull off some high 14's...<P>----&gt; <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/banditbalz/" TARGET=_blank>www.geocities.com/banditbalz/</A> <BR>.<BR>maybe we can talk Lothar into bringing his new 88 GT turbo... i will talk to him!<P><BR><P>------------------<BR>Silver 86 GT<BR>completely stock,<BR>completely fast!||||reg||12
