Z||000005||Slammed Fiero||05-30-2001||10:10 PM||||Jay , what did you do to your car to make it run quicker??? I thought you were running high 13's<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1607505&a=12259132&p=48230089&Sequence=0&res=high">     <BR>Jonathan McCreery<BR>86 GT 4spd<BR>Koni's , Coilovers, Big Bars , 17" Trmotorsports Typhoons , 11.25" vented discs, Wilwood 4 Piston Calipers , Pirelli P Zero's, Short Shift, No cat , Cold air induction , Geni Stainless tips, White face gauges , Momo shift , momo pedals..Autocrossed , Tracked , abused.||||reg||1
Z||000006||RaidenCobra||05-30-2001||10:18 PM||||Yah, I'll be there..<BR>In my Sport LX (dodge spirit)<BR>Damn good car!  Uhh wait..  It sucks really bad.. It stumbles on acceleration, the shocks are toast, loud knocking, ticking, humming and about every other noise posible coming from the engine. <P>||||reg||10
Z||000007||Jay||05-31-2001||12:09 AM||||JM, I removed the resonators from the exhaust (it was very restrictive).  Now I only have two cats on a true duel system.  I also removed the power steering pully and the A/C compressor and shortened the belt, less drag.  I've also hooked up the  sport shift select on the tranny.  The car feels way faster now and I've been dying to go to the track to try it out.  I'll keep you informed about my times.  Last year I ran 13.8 @ 100mph before the mods.  I had the car dynoed after the mods and I had an average of 255hp at the wheels, and I had one run reach 302.6hp, then the speed limiter kicked in at 145mph!  That is next to go, just waiting on Chris!<P>------------------<BR>Jay<BR>1986 Northstar GT<BR>www.members.home.net/jaygrande<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/kick.gif">  <BR>THE NORTHSTAR GIVES YOU A REAL KICK IN THE ASS!!!||||reg||1
Z||000008||northstar87||05-31-2001||10:30 AM||||Hi Jay,<BR>   It takes forever to get on the dyno at Lingenfelter.  It is going to take a while before I can get anything done.  I will let you know as soon as I get on the thing. <P>Chris Moore<BR>ASE Master Auto Tech <BR>Auto Instructor<BR>1986 GT Convertible Northstar<BR>1987 GT Northstar<BR>1988 GT T-TOP 3.4 5 speed<BR>1988 GT T-TOP stock||||reg||1
Z||000009||Slammed Fiero||05-31-2001||10:54 AM||||Chris you still alive??<P>I sent your money for the hubs & pod<P>Let me know <P>JM ||||reg||1
